      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "anchor": "overview"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "The Assistant Professor adds special enchants to Sarah's Earrings."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Each Sarah's Earring can get up to 2 enchants, in the order slot 4 → slot 3."
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "title": "Requirements",
      "text": "According to the script, the NPC can only be used after meeting the Sarah and Fenrir progress requirements."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "How It Works",
      "anchor": "process"
    },
